{"timestamp":"2026-08-12T23:18:11Z","action":"complaint","word":"t","murky":"One round of drawing: the app looks at what changed and brings the screen up to date, then stops until something changes again.\n\nI used the word for two different things in the same breath — one round of drawing, and handing a thing over. That is my murk, not the swap hook's.","plain":"One redraw of the screen.\n\nSomething changes, the app puts the change on screen, and it goes quiet again. That whole burst is what I called a round of drawing."}
